{"data":[{"id":"11447","type":"anime","links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/anime/11447"},"attributes":{"createdAt":"2015-10-17T19:25:46.411Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-21T18:00:15.002Z","slug":"hai-to-gensou-no-grimgar","synopsis":"Fear, survival, instinct. Thrown into a foreign land with nothing but hazy memories and the knowledge of their name, they can feel only these three emotions resonating deep within their souls. A group of strangers is given no other choice than to accept the only paying job in this game-like world—the role of a soldier in the Reserve Army—and eliminate anything that threatens the peace in their new world, Grimgar.\n\nWhen all of the stronger candidates join together, those left behind must create a party together to survive: Manato, a charismatic leader and priest; Haruhiro, a nervous thief; Yume, a cheerful hunter; Shihoru, a shy mage; Mogzo, a kind warrior; and Ranta, a rowdy dark knight. Despite its resemblance to one, this is no game—there are no redos or respawns; it is kill or be killed.\n\nIt is now up to this ragtag group of unlikely fighters to survive together in a world where life and death are separated only by a fine line.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)","description":"Fear, survival, instinct. Thrown into a foreign land with nothing but hazy memories and the knowledge of their name, they can feel only these three emotions resonating deep within their souls. A group of strangers is given no other choice than to accept the only paying job in this game-like world—the role of a soldier in the Reserve Army—and eliminate anything that threatens the peace in their new world, Grimgar.\n\nWhen all of the stronger candidates join together, those left behind must create a party together to survive: Manato, a charismatic leader and priest; Haruhiro, a nervous thief; Yume, a cheerful hunter; Shihoru, a shy mage; Mogzo, a kind warrior; and Ranta, a rowdy dark knight. Despite its resemblance to one, this is no game—there are no redos or respawns; it is kill or be killed.\n\nIt is now up to this ragtag group of unlikely fighters to survive together in a world where life and death are separated only by a fine line.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)","coverImageTopOffset":250,"titles":{"en":"Grimgar, Ashes and Illusions","en_jp":"Hai to Gensou no Grimgar","en_us":"Grimgar: Ashes and Illusions","ja_jp":"灰と幻想のグリムガル"},"canonicalTitle":"Hai to Gensou no Grimgar","abbreviatedTitles":["Grimgar of Fantasy and Ash","Grimgal of Ashes and Illusion","Grimgal of Ashes and Fantasies","Hai to Gensou no Grimgal"],"averageRating":"76.58","ratingFrequencies":{"2":"156","3":"3","4":"123","5":"11","6":"220","7":"8","8":"678","9":"26","10":"903","11":"45","12":"1812","13":"155","14":"4462","15":"299","16":"5019","17":"299","18":"2853","19":"110","20":"3295"},"userCount":47482,"favoritesCount":448,"startDate":"2016-01-11","endDate":"2016-03-28","nextRelease":null,"popularityRank":302,"ratingRank":1852,"ageRating":"PG","ageRatingGuide":"Teens 13 or older","subtype":"TV","status":"finished","tba":null,"posterImage":{"tiny":"https://media.kitsu.app/anime/poster_images/11447/tiny.jpg","large":"https://media.kitsu.app/anime/poster_images/11447/large.jpg","small":"https://media.kitsu.app/anime/poster_images/11447/small.jpg","medium":"https://media.kitsu.app/anime/poster_images/11447/medium.jpg","original":"https://media.kitsu.app/anime/poster_images/11447/original.png","meta":{"dimensions":{"tiny":{"width":110,"height":156},"large":{"width":550,"height":780},"small":{"width":284,"height":402},"medium":{"width":390,"height":554}}}},"coverImage":{"tiny":"https://media.kitsu.app/anime/cover_images/11447/tiny.jpg","large":"https://media.kitsu.app/anime/cover_images/11447/large.jpg","small":"https://media.kitsu.app/anime/cover_images/11447/small.jpg","original":"https://media.kitsu.app/anime/cover_images/11447/original.jpg","meta":{"dimensions":{"tiny":{"width":840,"height":200},"large":{"width":3360,"height":800},"small":{"width":1680,"height":400}